  NameBox: {fileID: 1666416504}
  DialogueText: {fileID: 581765100}
  NameText: {fileID: 2061986584}
  DialogueLines:
  - "Eleanore? sigh No, you\u2019re not Eleanore are you."
  - Maybe leaving isn't such a bad idea.
  - I know I have been nothing but trouble for you, but thank you for persisting
    all this time.
  - May you one day meet my Eleanor.
  - "If you do, tell her daddy misses her and that he\u2019s sorry."
  NPCName: Thomas
  TypeSpeed: 0.05
  _LineDelay: 2
  _EndDelay: 7
  height: 2
